# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .shopifyignore — files excluded from `shopify theme push`
# (does NOT affect ZIP packaging for Theme Store submission)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Demo-store seeding scripts / GraphQL — not part of the shipped theme
demo/

# Marketing/store-listing assets — only needed for the submission ZIP
screenshots/
listings/
SUBMISSION.md
release-notes.md

# NOTE: config/settings_data.json is NOT ignored here — pushing it is what
# installs presets (Theme styles) and color schemes on a theme. When pushing
# to the LIVE theme with merchant-edited settings, pass
# `--ignore config/settings_data.json` explicitly so merchant settings and
# section customizations are never overwritten.
